('anna-karenina','en','0cbbaeed5a332fd76206af274764c5585f37cf3aec1c30dcb51c314093091b9b','The Tula outline locates the region of Yasnaya Polyana, a documented literary model. It does not establish that Levin’s fictional estate lies anywhere specific in the modern oblast.','The Tula outline locates the region of Yasnaya Polyana, a documented literary model. It does not establish that Levin’s fictional estate lies anywhere specific in the modern oblast.'),
('anna-karenina','it','0cbbaeed5a332fd76206af274764c5585f37cf3aec1c30dcb51c314093091b9b','The Tula outline locates the region of Yasnaya Polyana, a documented literary model. It does not establish that Levin’s fictional estate lies anywhere specific in the modern oblast.','Il contorno di Tula indica la regione di Jasnaja Poljana, modello letterario documentato. Non stabilisce una posizione della tenuta immaginaria di Levin nell’attuale oblast.'),
('anna-karenina','fr','0cbbaeed5a332fd76206af274764c5585f37cf3aec1c30dcb51c314093091b9b','The Tula outline locates the region of Yasnaya Polyana, a documented literary model. It does not establish that Levin’s fictional estate lies anywhere specific in the modern oblast.','Le contour de Toula indique la région de Iasnaïa Poliana, modèle littéraire documenté. Il n’établit aucune position du domaine fictif de Lévine dans l’oblast actuel.'),
('anna-karenina','es','0cbbaeed5a332fd76206af274764c5585f37cf3aec1c30dcb51c314093091b9b','The Tula outline locates the region of Yasnaya Polyana, a documented literary model. It does not establish that Levin’s fictional estate lies anywhere specific in the modern oblast.','El contorno de Tula indica la región de Yásnaya Poliana, modelo literario documentado. No establece una posición de la finca ficticia de Levin en el óblast actual.'),
('anna-karenina','en','4e3429a5ce3eca8c85815ec09a3dc1a46c5cbe5a673c62209feeae47675ca160','The narrative context is northern Mississippi. The outline shows the whole state as a broad geographical reference; it does not define a northern subregion, Yoknapatawpha or Jefferson. Oxford remains a documented model, not the fictional town.','The narrative context is northern Mississippi. The outline shows the whole state as a broad geographical reference; it does not define a northern subregion, Yoknapatawpha or Jefferson. Oxford remains a documented model, not the fictional town.'),
('anna-karenina','it','4e3429a5ce3eca8c85815ec09a3dc1a46c5cbe5a673c62209feeae47675ca160','The narrative context is northern Mississippi. The outline shows the whole state as a broad geographical reference; it does not define a northern subregion, Yoknapatawpha or Jefferson. Oxford remains a documented model, not the fictional town.','Il contesto narrativo è il Mississippi settentrionale. Il contorno mostra l’intero Stato come riferimento geografico ampio: non delimita una sottoregione settentrionale, Yoknapatawpha o Jefferson. Oxford resta un modello documentato, non la città immaginaria.'),
('anna-karenina','fr','4e3429a5ce3eca8c85815ec09a3dc1a46c5cbe5a673c62209feeae47675ca160','The narrative context is northern Mississippi. The outline shows the whole state as a broad geographical reference; it does not define a northern subregion, Yoknapatawpha or Jefferson. Oxford remains a documented model, not the fictional town.','Le contexte narratif est le nord du Mississippi. Le contour montre l’État entier comme repère géographique large : il ne délimite ni sous-région septentrionale, ni Yoknapatawpha, ni Jefferson. Oxford reste un modèle documenté, pas la ville fictive.'),
('anna-karenina','es','4e3429a5ce3eca8c85815ec09a3dc1a46c5cbe5a673c62209feeae47675ca160','The narrative context is northern Mississippi. The outline shows the whole state as a broad geographical reference; it does not define a northern subregion, Yoknapatawpha or Jefferson. Oxford remains a documented model, not the fictional town.','El contexto narrativo es el norte de Misisipi. El contorno muestra todo el estado como referencia geográfica amplia: no delimita una subregión septentrional, Yoknapatawpha ni Jefferson. Oxford sigue siendo un modelo documentado, no la ciudad ficticia.'),
('anna-karenina','en','3e08ebed207ddd78c14eb07f80a6163e777124a6c79ae861a644612248b399f9','The outline of modern Ethiopia only orients the literary reference to Etiopía. It is not the boundary of Micomicón or a reconstruction of early modern Aethiopia.','The outline of modern Ethiopia only orients the literary reference to Etiopía. It is not the boundary of Micomicón or a reconstruction of early modern Aethiopia.'),
('anna-karenina','it','3e08ebed207ddd78c14eb07f80a6163e777124a6c79ae861a644612248b399f9','The outline of modern Ethiopia only orients the literary reference to Etiopía. It is not the boundary of Micomicón or a reconstruction of early modern Aethiopia.','Il contorno dell’Etiopia attuale orienta soltanto il riferimento letterario a Etiopía. Non è il confine di Micomicón né una ricostruzione dell’Aethiopia della prima età moderna.'),
('anna-karenina','fr','3e08ebed207ddd78c14eb07f80a6163e777124a6c79ae861a644612248b399f9','The outline of modern Ethiopia only orients the literary reference to Etiopía. It is not the boundary of Micomicón or a reconstruction of early modern Aethiopia.','Le contour de l’Éthiopie actuelle situe seulement la référence littéraire à Etiopía. Ce n’est ni la frontière de Micomicón ni une reconstitution de l’Aethiopia du début de l’époque moderne.'),
('anna-karenina','es','3e08ebed207ddd78c14eb07f80a6163e777124a6c79ae861a644612248b399f9','The outline of modern Ethiopia only orients the literary reference to Etiopía. It is not the boundary of Micomicón or a reconstruction of early modern Aethiopia.','El contorno de la Etiopía actual solo orienta la referencia literaria a Etiopía. No es la frontera de Micomicón ni una reconstrucción de la Aethiopia de la Edad Moderna.'),
