('gatsby','en','34e1321c2abbef2a66992b2004a4461c58a391137d447144c3cebe163959ad3e','The dashed outline shows the sourced geographical context, not the limits of a fictional place or an exact scene position. Existing narrative categories and quotations are retained.','The dashed outline shows the sourced geographical context, not the limits of a fictional place or an exact scene position. Existing narrative categories and quotations are retained.'),
('gatsby','it','34e1321c2abbef2a66992b2004a4461c58a391137d447144c3cebe163959ad3e','The dashed outline shows the sourced geographical context, not the limits of a fictional place or an exact scene position. Existing narrative categories and quotations are retained.','Il contorno tratteggiato mostra il contesto geografico documentato, non i confini di un luogo immaginario né la posizione esatta di una scena. Categorie narrative e citazioni esistenti sono conservate.'),
('gatsby','fr','34e1321c2abbef2a66992b2004a4461c58a391137d447144c3cebe163959ad3e','The dashed outline shows the sourced geographical context, not the limits of a fictional place or an exact scene position. Existing narrative categories and quotations are retained.','Le contour en pointillés montre le contexte géographique documenté, pas les limites d’un lieu fictif ni la position exacte d’une scène. Les catégories narratives et citations existantes sont conservées.'),
('gatsby','es','34e1321c2abbef2a66992b2004a4461c58a391137d447144c3cebe163959ad3e','The dashed outline shows the sourced geographical context, not the limits of a fictional place or an exact scene position. Existing narrative categories and quotations are retained.','El contorno discontinuo muestra el contexto geográfico documentado, no los límites de un lugar ficticio ni la posición exacta de una escena. Se conservan las categorías narrativas y citas existentes.'),
('gatsby','en','6ba96ed6c09b8a64a06d4c9c5f1c084f75bd5283c84952611891d69c28874bbe','Regional outlines give geographical context without assigning fictional addresses. Real literary models remain explicitly identified as models.','Regional outlines give geographical context without assigning fictional addresses. Real literary models remain explicitly identified as models.'),
('gatsby','it','6ba96ed6c09b8a64a06d4c9c5f1c084f75bd5283c84952611891d69c28874bbe','Regional outlines give geographical context without assigning fictional addresses. Real literary models remain explicitly identified as models.','I contorni regionali offrono un contesto geografico senza assegnare indirizzi immaginari. I modelli letterari reali restano indicati esplicitamente come modelli.'),
('gatsby','fr','6ba96ed6c09b8a64a06d4c9c5f1c084f75bd5283c84952611891d69c28874bbe','Regional outlines give geographical context without assigning fictional addresses. Real literary models remain explicitly identified as models.','Les contours régionaux offrent un contexte géographique sans attribuer d’adresses fictives. Les modèles littéraires réels restent explicitement désignés comme modèles.'),
('gatsby','es','6ba96ed6c09b8a64a06d4c9c5f1c084f75bd5283c84952611891d69c28874bbe','Regional outlines give geographical context without assigning fictional addresses. Real literary models remain explicitly identified as models.','Los contornos regionales ofrecen un contexto geográfico sin asignar direcciones ficticias. Los modelos literarios reales siguen identificados expresamente como modelos.'),
('gatsby','en','ad3d2cd3129bf90c70c3b0501f513e0483d39346ae69dbe43a48520dcc6328c0','The outline follows the cited cartographic source. Scale, generalization and the distinction between modern geographical context and historical or fictional boundaries are documented in the review.','The outline follows the cited cartographic source. Scale, generalization and the distinction between modern geographical context and historical or fictional boundaries are documented in the review.'),
